lookup>), or <highlight>pine</highlight>; — √dubious; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,19)\">Isa 41:19</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> derives from <bdbheb>דהר</bdbheb> <highlight>endure</highlight> inferred from Arabic <placeholder1096/> <highlight>time</highlight>, but this questionable; perhaps a loan-word), <bdbheb>בְּרוֺשׁ תִּדְהָר וּתְאַשּׁוּר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>יַחְדָּו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,19)\">Isa 41:19</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 60:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,13)\">Isa 60:13</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 41:19", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 41, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Isa 60:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 60, "verse": 13}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["תִּדְהָר", "ᵑ9", "דהר", "בְּרוֺשׁ תִּדְהָר וּתְאַשּׁוּר", "יַחְדָּו"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Che", "Di", "Dozy", "Ges", "Lag", "Lane", "Löw", "PS", "Rabb", "Symm", "Thes", "Vg"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB1857", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}